usage: gitreins serve [-h] [--port PORT] [--host HOST] [--repo REPO]
                      [--project PROJECT] [--open]

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --port PORT        Port to bind (default 8616)
  --host HOST        Bind address (default 127.0.0.1)
  --repo REPO        Browse another checkout's judgments by path (default: the
                     repository you run from)
  --project PROJECT  Scheduler project name for the tick ledger (e.g.
                     gitreins)
  --open             Open the browser automatically
